    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's helpful. one thing i'm worried about is those weird little edge cases where things look fine on a dev device but then just break for users with specific accessibility settings—like when focus states vanish or screen readers skip over something important. how should i document those kinds of bugs in my audit?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
