      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Document these edge cases by creating specific bug tickets that detail the exact device model, keyboard navigation steps, and nature of the skipped content, ensuring your audit report explicitly notes how specific OS accessibility features (like VoiceOver or TalkBack) interact with the app's code. Include screenshots or screen recordings in your findings that visualize the failure mode to make the issue reproducible for developers. Finally, prioritize these issues in your severity classification based on whether they prevent a user from interacting with the core functionality or merely degrading the experience.",
