      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah makes sense. i'm just trying to figure out how to categorize them in the report. sometimes it feels like these glitches are just... random. like they're small, annoying things that just pop up and ruin the flow for no reason. is there a specific way to describe those kinds of unpredictable UX disruptions?",
